Khara drives chariot straight at lone bowman Rāma --- Demons surround Rāma showering maces swords spears --- Rāma receives missiles like ocean receiving rivers --- Bloodied Rāma stands unshaken like struck mountain --- Rāma looses hundreds of deathlike arrows playfully --- Arrows sever bows flags armor heads and thighs --- Shattered survivors flee arrow-wounded to Khara --- Dūṣaṇa rallies fugitives and charges Rāma again